Subject: [PATCH] drivers: power: supply: Import ln8000_charger

* from branch: sweet_k6a-r-oss

Change-Id: If6a5f92508a7429b430e77da3b056de9867fd2e4
Signed-off-by: Mr-Morat <mtarom124@gmail.com>
---
