From 903b0530e3a30840a1720a771eebd96b2841c314 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vantoman <Mustafa.vantom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Feb 2025 10:54:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] power: ti: pd_policy_manager: Increase hysteresis to 30 mV

